TASK B06
	TITLE "brigade run: launch a role run through an adapter and capture its result"
	STATUS draft
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M0
	COMPONENT "runs"
	ROLE bastien
	SPEC "runs a procedure as a role through the adapter of the project, detached under systemd-run"
		+ "or in the foreground"
	SPEC "writes the normalised result to the ledger: text, ok, exit_code and the raw message"
		+ "always; usage, duration_ms, turns, cost, error_kind, resets_at and session_ref when the"
		+ "adapter reports them"
	SPEC "passes the role package through the adapter, which hands it to its CLI as part of the"
		+ "system prompt"
	SPEC "the Claude Code adapter is the first: headless mode, a streamed JSON result mapped to the"
		+ "normalised result"
	AFTER @TASK.B05
	AFTER @TASK.B42

