TASK B40
	TITLE "Evaluate rtk as a candidate filter of shell output"
	STATUS draft
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M6
	COMPONENT "runs"
	ROLE dora
	ROLE prudence
	SPEC "rtk (github.com/rtk-ai/rtk) is installed for implementation runs only, telemetry"
		+ "disabled, its hook proven to coexist with the hooks of the instructions corpus and never"
		+ "to rewrite an awawa command"
	SPEC "implementation runs read compact output: failures only, the test runner in fail-fast mode"
		+ "(bun test --bail, pytest -x)"
	SPEC "verification runs read full raw output: the verifier's pass, the merge gate of the tick"
		+ "and the evidence quoted in a report run without rtk or through rtk run"
	SPEC "a run that needs the full output of a filtered command recovers it with rtk recall"
		+ "instead of re-running it"
	SPEC "the ledger compares one wave with rtk and one without: agent steps, re-reads of oversized"
		+ "output, findings missed by the verifier"
	SPEC "a DECISION records the adoption or the rejection, with the measured comparison"
	AFTER @TASK.B21

TASK B41
	TITLE "Mirror the corpus task statuses to the Blueprint board"
	STATUS draft
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M3
	COMPONENT "artifact"
	ROLE bastien
	SPEC "brigade board sync reads every TASK of the repository corpus through the corpus reader"
		+ "and writes its STATUS to the field status of the document tasks/<id> of the board's"
		+ "tasks collection; a second sync writes nothing"
	SPEC "the board renders the corpus's statuses, draft, todo, implemented and archived, as they"
		+ "are or through one mapping declared in one place of the page; the sync writes nothing"
		+ "while the board cannot display a corpus value"
	SPEC "the board's status control is read-only, or records a proposal in a field of its own that"
		+ "the sync never overwrites; no action of the page writes status"
	SPEC "the sync prints the documents it wrote, text and --json, and exits 1 when the board holds"
		+ "a task the corpus does not"
	AFTER @TASK.B08
	RATIONALE "the board page of 2026-10-04 edits status in a vocabulary of its own, todo, doing,"
		+ "review, done and blocked, and cannot display draft; its documents all hold todo while"
		+ "the corpus holds draft"
	SOURCE "@DECISION.TheCorpusIsTheHomeOfTaskStatusTheBoardItsView, pull request #1 of the brigade"
		+ "repository"

TASK B42
	TITLE "Agent-CLI adapter interface"
	STATUS draft
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M0
	COMPONENT "runs"
	ROLE bastien
	SPEC "an adapter is one module with start(prompt) and resume(session_ref, prompt), both"
		+ "returning the normalised result (text, ok, exit_code, raw always; usage, duration_ms,"
		+ "turns, cost, error_kind, resets_at optional), transcript(transcript_ref) returning"
		+ "neutral events, and a declaration of its capabilities"
	SPEC "session_ref and transcript_ref are opaque strings the core stores and never parses"
	SPEC "a fake adapter without session_ref and without resets_at proves the fallbacks: relaunch"
		+ "with the progress file, now plus 30 minutes"
	SPEC "the core imports no adapter by name: PROJECT.ADAPTER names it, the first adapter when"
		+ "absent"
	SPEC "a fake adapter in the tests proves the core runs with no agent CLI installed"
	SPEC "no file outside the adapters names a flag, a hook, a session file or a command of one"
		+ "CLI; a test proves it"
	AFTER @TASK.B01
	SOURCE "@DECISION.BrigadeNamesNoAgentCliEachCliIsAnAdapter"

TASK B43
	TITLE "Default roles shipped with brigade"
	STATUS draft
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M7
	COMPONENT "roles"
	ROLE lex
	ROLE bastien
	SPEC "the default roles cover every role the wave lifecycle launches: ada, bastien, prudence,"
		+ "remi, manu, rita and mina"
	SPEC "each is an AGENT entity with WORK, REASONING and RETURNS, with the rules it loads, in an"
		+ "awawa corpus shipped with the package that lints strict"
	SPEC "brigade init with ROLES default installs that corpus in the config directory"
	SPEC "a wave runs on a machine with no instructions corpus"
	AFTER @TASK.B09
	SOURCE "@DECISION.BrigadeIsShareableFromTheStart"

TASK B44
	TITLE "CLI contract: CONTRACT entities and black-box tests"
	STATUS draft
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M0
	COMPONENT "cli"
	ROLE bastien
	SPEC "the shape of every --json output and of every state file is a CONTRACT entity of this"
		+ "corpus, written at the delivery of its command"
	SPEC "a black-box test per command runs it by subprocess and checks its --json output against"
		+ "its CONTRACT"
	SPEC "a test loads every file under the state directory as JSON, JSON lines or text; a file of"
		+ "another format fails it"
	AFTER @TASK.B01
	SOURCE "@DECISION.TheCommandLineIsTheContract"

